			"notes": "- Fixed Babel loop helpers containing `continue` not being transformed.\n- Extended AST traversal to handle loops inside `return _createClass()`.\n- Fixed `ReferenceError` when accessing variables declared in a `for` initializer outside the loop in Rhino, including the `\"n\" is not defined` error in Babel’s array-copy helper.\n- Added regression tests for loop control flow, variable capture in deferred callbacks, and nested function scopes."
		},
