			"notes": "- Added `/kubex export`\n- Export compiled KubeJS projects as standalone mod JARs\n- Exported JARs require KubeJS, but no longer require KubeX\n- Added `kubex/export.properties` for mod metadata and dependencies\n- Added required `mod.package` setting for the generated KubeJS plugin class\n- Exported JARs include processed scripts, `assets`, and `data`\n- Added optional exported-mod dependency settings with `dependency.<modid>.*`\n- Export output is written to `kubex/export/`"
