			"notes": "- Source map line correction improved for more accurate `/kubex doctor` and runtime error locations.\n- `/kubex build` now writes progress to `kubex/.kubex-status.json`.\n- Added `rebuildOnGameStart` NeoForge config option, disabled by default.\n- `/kubex init` now copies missing files from `kubex/templates/common` without overwriting existing workspace files.\n- Added a workspace `.gitignore` template.\n- Updated KubeJS to `2101.7.2-build.374`.\n- Updated Rhino to `2101.2.8-build.91`.\n- Reorganized core, workspace, command, and NeoForge code structure.\n- Removed the unnecessary KubeJS Gradle compile dependency while keeping KubeJS as a required runtime dependency."
